WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:07.076
This is the EnMD Digital Platform,
from the Energy Management

2
00:00:07.076 --> 00:00:11.979
Division of the National Cleaner
Production Centre, Sri Lanka.

3
00:00:12.329 --> 00:00:15.794
Every energy audit tool the
division uses, in

4
00:00:15.794 --> 00:00:19.562
one website, on your
computer, tablet or phone.

5
00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:26.477
Open it in any browser. On a phone, the
same pages fit the small screen.

6
00:00:28.033 --> 00:00:32.165
Press Get started, and type the
four digit access code. It

7
00:00:32.165 --> 00:00:36.802
is asked once each time you open the
platform in a browser tab.

8
00:00:38.367 --> 00:00:41.674
The dashboard shows seven tools
as coloured tiles.

9
00:00:42.024 --> 00:00:46.995
Type in the search box to find one
quickly, and tap a tile to open it.

10
00:00:48.533 --> 00:00:53.299
The solar, compressor, boiler, air
conditioning and ESO tools are

11
00:00:53.299 --> 00:00:58.582
built from the division's own Excel
workbooks, with the same formulas.

12
00:00:58.932 --> 00:01:04.735
Change a highlighted box, and every result,
chart and check updates straight away.

13
00:01:05.085 --> 00:01:09.539
The calculations were checked against
LibreOffice with many random

14
00:01:09.539 --> 00:01:14.345
sets of inputs, and your values are
saved on this device as you work.

15
00:01:15.900 --> 00:01:20.832
Inputs that matter most carry an orange
Critical badge. A ten percent

16
00:01:20.832 --> 00:01:25.629
change in one of them moves a key
result by five percent or more.

17
00:01:25.979 --> 00:01:30.438
Tap the badge to see which result it
changes, and by how much.

18
00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:35.038
The checks panel shows the
workbook's own model

19
00:01:35.038 --> 00:01:38.550
checks. A green tick means
everything is consistent.

20
00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:43.898
When you finish, use the Download
group at the top right.

21
00:01:44.248 --> 00:01:48.510
Word makes a complete report, with a
cover page, summary, your

22
00:01:48.510 --> 00:01:53.059
inputs, every result, the checks,
charts and a sign-off section.

23
00:01:53.409 --> 00:01:57.549
Excel gives back the filled
workbook, with all its formulas.

24
00:01:59.100 --> 00:02:06.069
LuxLog is the lighting survey app. Sketch
each area, place the measured lux at

25
00:02:06.069 --> 00:02:13.991
each spot, and every reading is rated against the
JIS Z9110 range and the OSHA minimum.

26
00:02:14.341 --> 00:02:18.801
View the building in 3D, and make
Word and Excel reports.

27
00:02:20.467 --> 00:02:24.852
The rooftop solar tool sizes the
system from the roof and the

28
00:02:24.852 --> 00:02:29.747
district, with sunshine data calibrated
to the Global Solar Atlas.

29
00:02:30.097 --> 00:02:33.641
It builds a cash flow of up to
30 years, with net

30
00:02:33.641 --> 00:02:37.479
present value, payback, and
seventeen model checks.

31
00:02:39.033 --> 00:02:43.226
The sub-meter tool checks site meters
against a reference logger.

32
00:02:43.226 --> 00:02:47.375
The units and the error of every
meter are worked out for you.

33
00:02:47.725 --> 00:02:51.534
Add photos and a signature, and
the Word report comes

34
00:02:51.534 --> 00:02:56.067
out in the division's template,
exactly like the Excel macro.

35
00:02:57.633 --> 00:03:02.041
The Smart ESO Sheet lists every
energy saving opportunity,

36
00:03:02.041 --> 00:03:05.762
one row per measure, just
like the Excel sheet.

37
00:03:06.112 --> 00:03:11.362
Cost and greenhouse gas savings use
current prices and IPCC

38
00:03:11.362 --> 00:03:17.206
2006 factors, and the Word export
matches the sheet's own table.

39
00:03:18.767 --> 00:03:22.996
The compressor tool compares the
existing machine with a new one

40
00:03:22.996 --> 00:03:27.706
at the same air demand, with pressure
correction and part load power.

41
00:03:29.267 --> 00:03:33.936
The boiler tool finds the efficiency by
the indirect heat loss method,

42
00:03:33.936 --> 00:03:39.422
and assesses five measures, with their
interaction and a safe stack temperature.

43
00:03:40.967 --> 00:03:45.337
The air conditioning tool compares
six system types against

44
00:03:45.337 --> 00:03:50.525
the existing non inverter units, in
energy, cost and carbon dioxide.

45
00:03:52.067 --> 00:03:55.808
Your work stays on your device.
In the sub-meter tool,

46
00:03:55.808 --> 00:03:59.491
Backup and Restore move an
audit to another device.

47
00:04:01.133 --> 00:04:05.239
The EnMD Digital Platform.
Developed by Vihindu

48
00:04:05.239 --> 00:04:09.582
Jayawardena, for the Energy
Management Division.

49
00:04:09.932 --> 00:04:11.917
Choose a tool, and
begin.
